    + 16 regs via 8 LDP                            1.465 ns   [1.439 .. 1.537]      4.0 cyc
    + 8 STP then 8 LDP (store-all/load-all)        2.994 ns   [2.668 .. 3.230]      8.2 cyc
  load+ALU+store (memory x86 insn)                 0.587 ns   [0.586 .. 0.614]      1.6 cyc
